<title>USA: Marvel lenders grant $15 mln credit access.</title>
<headline>Marvel lenders grant $15 mln credit access.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marvel Entertainment Group Inc said Tuesday its senior lender group led by Chase Manhattan Bank approved a waiver allowing Marvel to draw from its remaining $15 million of revolving credit.</p>
<p>The company is seeking $130 million of additional credit, it added.</p>
<p>Marvel said it will use the additional credit to finance its 1997 investments and working capital requirements in connection with Andrews Group Inc's proposal to invest new equity in the company and make Toy Biz Inc one of Marvel's units.</p>
</text>
